  Copyright (C) 2026 Diego P. (iKarTehFox) and contributors

  Local manifest for ZTE Z981 (urd) - LineageOS 16.0

  Based on:
    https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ZTE-ZMAX-PRO/local_manifest/lineage-16.0/urd_manifest.xml

  FIX: the upstream manifest points the kernel at revision="lineage-16.0", but
  ZTE-ZMAX-PRO/android_kernel_zte_urd has NO such branch. Its branches are:
      9.x, 9.x-test, cm-14.1-new, lineage-15.1,
      lineage-16.0-f2fs, lineage-16.0-f2fs-experimental,
      lineage-16.0-new, lineage-16.0-new-dev, stock-urd-6.0.1
  The correct one is `lineage-16.0-new` (2019-05-14, "urd/defconfig: Regenerate"),
  which matches the device tree's lineage-16.0 branch and the ROM build date.
  Without this override, `repo sync` fails with:
      fatal: Couldn't find remote ref refs/heads/lineage-16.0

  FORKS: the three device-specific projects are pulled from my forks rather
  than the ZTE-ZMAX-PRO originals. The originals are dormant hobby repos for a
  2016 device; if they are deleted or made private, a fresh `repo sync` breaks
  with no mirror. The forks are kept in sync with upstream and give us control
  over their lifetime. Branch names are identical to upstream:
      android_device_zte_urd : lineage-16.0
      android_kernel_zte_urd : lineage-16.0-new
      vendor_zte_urd         : lineage-16.0

  The forks also carry the device/vendor/kernel fixes that used to be applied
  by patch-*.py at build time (see the README). Because `repo sync` pulls the
  forks, those changes now persist instead of being re-applied every build.
-->
<manifest>
  <project path="packages/resources/devicesettings"
           name="LineageOS/android_packages_resources_devicesettings"
           revision="lineage-16.0" />

  <project name="iKarTehFox/android_device_zte_urd"
           path="device/zte/urd"
           remote="github"
           revision="lineage-16.0" />

  <project name="iKarTehFox/vendor_zte_urd"
           path="vendor/zte/urd"
           remote="github"
           revision="lineage-16.0" />

  <project name="iKarTehFox/android_kernel_zte_urd"
           path="kernel/zte/urd"
           remote="github"
           revision="lineage-16.0-new" />
</manifest>
